    "title": "Summer break begins, so does the battle with teen screen time - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Brayden Willis ,\n5 hours ago LANSING, Mich. (News 10) - Half of teenagers aged 12 to 17 clock four or more hours of screen time every day, according to the Centers for Disease Control and Prevention. Everett High School freshman Draylen Gist said he uses his phone as an outlet for creativity, but also gets caught in endless scrolling algorithms. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
